            "text": "$Q$ is $500\\%$ of $P$, because $Q/P=1/(20/100)=5$."
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$Q$ is $20\\%$ of $P$, because the percentage stays the same when the comparison is reversed."
          }
        ]
